top to bottom direction

card "**DATA ENGINEERING**\n\n<size:15><b>Producer</b></size>\n\n<size:14><b>Role:</b></size>\n<size:14>• Infrastructure</size>\n<size:14>• Pipelines</size>\n<size:14>• Quality</size>\n<size:14>• Reliability</size>\n\n<size:13><i>\"Make data available\"</i></size>" as DE <<Primary>>

