card "**ANALYTICS**\n\n<size:15><b>Consumer</b></size>\n\n<size:14><b>Role:</b></size>\n<size:14>• Reports</size>\n<size:14>• Dashboards</size>\n<size:14>• KPIs</size>\n<size:14>• Decisions</size>\n\n<size:13><i>\"Turn data to decisions\"</i></size>" as A <<Task>>

DE -down-> R : **Provides**
